Third-party data
----------------
The optional "exam" feature expects a local copy of the LCCC corpus
(https://github.com/thu-coai/CDial-GPT). No corpus data is distributed with
this repository. Download it yourself and comply with its license.

DeepSeek Harness is a separate product. This repository only contains plugins
that run inside it; it does not redistribute the host application.
